          "_name": "article01",
          "_sourceTheme": "trustm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article01 trustm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Desc Color\" value=\"#30262b\" name=\"desc\" condition=\"showDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trustm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trustm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrapper\"><b>\n                        What We Look For.\n                    </b></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">An offer does not need to be famous, inexpensive or universally useful.<br><br>It does need to make sense.<br><br>Every potential addition is considered through several editorial lenses.<br>\n<br><b>Clear Use Case\n<br></b>\n<br>It should solve a real problem, improve a process or create a meaningful advantage.<br><br>If it is difficult to explain why someone would reasonably use something, it probably does not belong in the Index.<br>\n<br><b>Distinct Enough to Matter\n<br></b>\n<br>Being available is not the same as being notable.<br><br>We look for meaningful differences in functionality, positioning, access, specialization, convenience or delivery.<br><br>There should be a clear reason to consider it instead of the obvious alternatives.<br>\n<br><b>Credible Delivery\n<br></b>\n<br>Promises matter less than whether there appears to be something credible behind them.<br><br>We consider how clearly an offer presents its product, service, pricing, policies, support and overall business operation.<br>\n<br><b>Clear Buyer Fit\n<br></b>\n<br>Very few products are right for everyone.<br><br>We look for offers made for a recognizable type of customer, so you can quickly tell whether something fits your needs, goals or situation.<br><br>Knowing who an offer is not for matters too.<br>\n<br><b>Worth The Price<br></b>\n<br>Low price does not automatically mean good value, and premium pricing does not automatically mean poor value.<br><br>We consider what you actually receive for the cost, including usefulness, capability, access, convenience, specialization and support.<br>\n<br><b>More Than Marketing<br></b>\n<br>Launch buzz eventually disappears.<br><br>What remains matters more.<br><br>We favor offers with real usefulness behind the sales pitch, not products that depend mainly on trends, urgency or exaggerated promises.<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
